# Keys at their defaults are not reported.
# References: ADR-1100 D14.
# spec: kitty graphics protocol (sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/graphics-protocol, read 2026-11-13), "Querying support for protocol features": "Keys with default values, as well as the a, i, I, m and q keys, are not included in the reply."
# covers: image.kitty
size 20 10
send "\e_Ga=q,i=37,e=t,f=32,t=d\e\\"
